.SH "نام (NAME)"
drumstick-dumpwrk \- A Drumstick command line utility for decoding WRK (Cakewalk) files\&.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBdrumstick\-dumpwrk\fR\ 'u
\fBdrumstick\-dumpwrk\fR [options] {FILE}
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This program is a Drumstick example and utility program\&. You can use it to decode as text your WRK files created with Cakewalk or Sonar\&.
.SH "ARGUMENTS"
.PP
The following argument is required:
.PP
\fBFILE\fR
.RS 4
The name of the input WRK file\&.
.RE
.PP
The following arguments are optional:
.PP
\fB\-h|\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Prints a summary of the command\-line options and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-v|\-\-version\fR
.RS 4
Prints the program version number and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
.RS 4
Verbose output\&.
.RE
